{"key":"enterprise/T1543","id":"T1543","name":"Create or Modify System Process","domain":"enterprise","level":"technique","parent_id":null,"tactics":["persistence","privilege-escalation"],"platforms":["Containers","Linux","macOS","Windows"],"environments":["cloud-hosted-endpoint","containers","onprem"],"environment_basis":"project_taxonomy_from_upstream_platforms","summary":"Adversaries may create or modify system-level processes to repeatedly execute malicious payloads as part of persistence. When operating systems boot up, they can start processes that perform background system functions. On Windows and Linux, these system processes are referred to as services. On macOS, launchd processes known as Launch Daemon and Launch Agent are run to finish system initialization and load user specific parameters. Adversaries…","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1543","source_stix_id":"attack-pattern--106c0cf6-bf73-4601-9aa8-0945c2715ec5","source_modified":"2026-05-12T15:12:00.621Z","source_object_version":"1.2","telemetry":{"status":"mapped","components":[{"id":"DC0064","name":"Command Execution","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0064","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--685f917a-e95e-4ba0-ade1-c7d354dae6e0","page":"telemetry/DC0064/"},{"id":"DC0072","name":"Container Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0072","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--a5ae90ca-0c4b-481c-959f-0eb18a7ff953","page":"telemetry/DC0072/"},{"id":"DC0061","name":"File Modification","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0061","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--84572de3-9583-4c73-aabd-06ea88123dd8","page":"telemetry/DC0061/"},{"id":"DC0032","name":"Process Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0032","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--3d20385b-24ef-40e1-9f56-f39750379077","page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"id":"DC0060","name":"Service Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0060","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--5297a638-1382-4f0c-8472-0d21830bf705","page":"telemetry/DC0060/"},{"id":"DC0063","name":"Windows Registry Key Modification","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0063","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--da85d358-741a-410d-9433-20d6269a6170","page":"telemetry/DC0063/"}],"strategies":[{"id":"DET0571","name":"Detection of System Process Creation or Modification Across Platforms","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0571","stix_id":"x-mitre-detection-strategy--dab6c58b-2f44-4539-93e1-b03990fc1649","relationship_id":"relationship--f2f4bc4a-1f7a-4cb8-8635-d8461de4480c"}],"analytics":[{"id":"AN1575","name":"Analytic 1575","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0571#AN1575","guidance":"Detects command-line or API-based creation/modification of Windows Services via `sc.exe`, `powershell.exe`, `services.exe`, or `ChangeServiceConfig`. Looks for creation/modification of autostart services via registry changes, file drops to `System32\\services`, and anomalous parent-child process trees.","platforms":["Windows"],"strategy_id":"DET0571"},{"id":"AN1576","name":"Analytic 1576","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0571#AN1576","guidance":"Detects creation or modification of `systemd` service units, addition of cron jobs that invoke binaries on boot, or suspicious writes to `/etc/init.d/`. Monitors `chmod +x` and `systemctl` execution paths, especially from non-root parent processes.","platforms":["Linux"],"strategy_id":"DET0571"},{"id":"AN1577","name":"Analytic 1577","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0571#AN1577","guidance":"Detects creation or modification of `LaunchDaemon` or `LaunchAgent` plist files under `/Library/LaunchDaemons/`, `~/Library/LaunchAgents/`, or similar. Monitors execution of `launchctl`, property list edits, and file permission changes.","platforms":["macOS"],"strategy_id":"DET0571"},{"id":"AN1578","name":"Analytic 1578","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0571#AN1578","guidance":"Detects creation of new container system processes via `docker run --restart`, `kubectl exec` to init containers, or modification of container init specs. Flags container images that override entrypoints to embed persistence behaviors.","platforms":["Containers"],"strategy_id":"DET0571"}],"log_sources":[{"component_id":"DC0060","component":"Service Creation","name":"WinEventLog:Security","channel":"EventCode=4697","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN1575","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0571#AN1575","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0060/"},{"component_id":"DC0032","component":"Process Creation","name":"WinEventLog:Sysmon","channel":"EventCode=1","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN1575","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0571#AN1575","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"component_id":"DC0063","component":"Windows Registry Key Modification","name":"WinEventLog:Sysmon","channel":"EventCode=13, 14","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN1575","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0571#AN1575","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0063/"},{"component_id":"DC0061","component":"File Modification","name":"auditd:SYSCALL","channel":"write or rename to /etc/systemd/system or /etc/init.d","platforms":["Linux"],"analytic_id":"AN1576","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0571#AN1576","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0061/"},{"component_id":"DC0064","component":"Command Execution","name":"auditd:SYSCALL","channel":"execution of systemctl or service with enable/start/modify","platforms":["Linux"],"analytic_id":"AN1576","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0571#AN1576","validation":"upstream_definition_no